{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年、明けましておめでとうございます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひつじ年だよみんな( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほやっほー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょじょじょ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/01/0324494/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2015年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにまだ初夢見てません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ...それよりなにより私の幸せすぎた出来事の話聞いていただけます？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......いやーあのですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノギビンゴ3で、かの有名な輩・能條のときに共演させていただいた私の永遠の憧れ 紫吹淳さんから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディナーショーがあるからとご招待をいただいたんです！！（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私に！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"招待ですよ！！（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんうちのマザーテレサが「行きた〜い！！！」と言ったのは言うまでもなく。\nということで一緒に行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディナーショーでは宝塚時代の曲もたくさん歌われて、途中から男役に大変身して私の大好きな作品「ガイズ&ドールズ」の曲も歌われました（；＿；）（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私は覚えてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6秒くらい目があったことを..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、もうなんですか神様ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カッコ良すぎだし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうカッコ良すぎだし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうカッコ良すぎだし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当大好きです/ _ ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとニヤニヤがバレないように口元に手をおいて幸せな時間を過ごしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツーショットも撮っていただけました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......見たい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、見たい......？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょーがないなあ...。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の宝物"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/01/0324494/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの顔が女の顔になってる。笑\nいや女だけどなんてゆーか女の顔になってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで私にもう一つ夢が出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おこがましい夢かもしれないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか紫吹淳さんと舞台で共演することです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやもう私は全然アンサンブルでもいい！全然！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年からは大好きな舞台にも挑戦したいと思っていたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当おこがましいけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか、いつか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共演がしたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"端っこの方でもいいから同じ舞台に立ちたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、私は頑張らにゃいかんのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年1年、\n川後が私につけてくれたあだ名、「暴れ馬」のように挑戦する心を忘れない、どんな壁も力づくでぶっ壊すような気持ちで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突っ走ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未はこんなもんじゃない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついてきてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/01/0324494/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大吉、引き寄せました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは？"}],"source":"archive"}